      "title": "PgBouncer",
      "gridPos": {
        "h": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### PgBouncer: not deployed\n\nThe upstream pack has three PgBouncer panels here (clients waiting, max client wait, server active connections). This stack connects n8n to RDS directly, so there is no PgBouncer and no `pgbouncer_*` or `cnpg_pgbouncer_*` series. The n8n-side pool panels on this dashboard (`n8n_db_pool_*`) and `pg_stat_activity_count` cover connection pressure without it.\n\nIf PgBouncer is added later, restore the panels from the upstream portable JSON and its `$pgjob` variable."
      }
